# PO Brainstorm — Skills Mandate

During po-relay Phase 4, run three separate lens sessions per [`po-relay/RITUAL.md`](../../docs/window-instances/po-relay/RITUAL.md). Read the skill file before each session.

## UX designer lens

Read: `.agents/skills/ux-heuristics/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/plan-design-review/SKILL.md`

Cross-check inspiration matrix in [`ux-relay/IDENTITY.md`](../../docs/window-instances/ux-relay/IDENTITY.md). Output to `BRAINSTORM_LOG` with tag `ux`.

## Product owner lens

Read: `.agents/skills/define-opportunity-tree/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/agile-product-owner/SKILL.md`

Mutate PO backlogs; feed `worker-relay/STATE.md` BACKLOG. Use `{keep|refine|merge|drop|add}`. Output to `BRAINSTORM_LOG` with tag `po`.

## Business owner lens

Read: `.agents/skills/jobs-to-be-done/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/hooked-ux/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/saas-metrics-coach/SKILL.md`

Evaluate retention ROI for Habits PWA. Output to `BRAINSTORM_LOG` with tag `business`.

## Rules

- No generic brainstorm without reading lens skills
- Rewrite useless requirements or drop with rationale
- Propose UI via `UI_PROPOSALS` — never write `ux-relay` `UI_POLISH_BACKLOG` directly
- Feed approved features to `docs/window-instances/worker-relay/STATE.md` BACKLOG
